test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0560450Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0560737Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0560993Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0561196Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0561397Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0561592Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0561804Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0562029Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0562210Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0562405Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0562613Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0562822Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0563062Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0563253Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0563416Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0564178Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0564560Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0564911Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0565202Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0565530Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0565879Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-23T23:23:20.0566153Z                         processor works.
